==============================================================================
B. merge lemma: min deletions blocking all simple merges of (P, C) == MB(P,C) = sum_delta (1 + asc_delta)
==============================================================================
1500 random (T, P, C) with |P| = 1..4, |C| = 3..5, |P||C| <= 12: brute-force minimum == MB formula on 1500/1500; distribution of MB - |C| (= total ascents): {0: 732, 1: 334, 2: 283, 3: 128, 4: 22, 5: 1}

